option.ANISOTROPIC_FILTERING.comment = Controls anisotropic texture filtering level.
option.ATMOSPHERE_RAIN_DESATURATION.comment = Desaturates the sky and sunlight color while it is raining
option.ATMOSPHERE_RAIN_DESATURATION_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the intensity of the rain desaturation
option.ATMOSPHERE_SATURATION_BOOST_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the intensity of the atmosphere saturation boost
option.BIOME_WATER_COLOR_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts how strongly the biome water color affects water absorption
option.BLOCKY_CLOUDS_ATMOSPHERIC_SCATTERING.comment = When enabled, tints clouds slightly red. This effect increases with distance
option.BLOCKY_CLOUDS_BOTTOMLIGHT.comment = Increases the brightness of the undersides of clouds
option.BLOCKY_CLOUDS_BRIGHTNESS.comment = Adjusts brightness.
option.BLOCKY_CLOUDS_DENSITY.comment = Adjusts the density of the clouds. Higher values increase noise
option.BLOCKY_CLOUDS_LIGHTING_STEPS.comment = Adjusts lighting steps.
option.BLOCKY_CLOUDS_PRIMARY_STEPS.comment = Adjusts primary steps.
option.BLOCKY_CLOUDS_SIZE.comment = Adjusts size.
option.BLOCKY_CLOUDS_WIND_ANGLE.comment = Adjusts wind angle.
option.BLOCKY_CLOUDS_WIND_SPEED.comment = Adjusts wind speed.
option.BORDER_FOG_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the intensity of border fog
option.CAVE_FOG_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the intensity of cave fog
option.CAVE_LIGHTING_FALLOFF.comment = Controls how quickly cave lighting fades out as skylight increases. Higher values restrict cave lighting to darker areas
option.COLOR_OUTPUT_MODE.comment = Color space of the final image. sRGB is the safe default; the wide-gamut options (Rec.2020, P3, Adobe RGB) need a display that supports them, otherwise switch back to sRGB
option.DESERT_SANDSTORM_INTENSITY.comment = How dense the sandstorm is during rain in desert biomes
option.DISTANCE_BLUR_START.comment = Adjusts the distance at which distance blur begins
option.DISTANT_BLUR_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the intensity of distance blur
option.DOF_MODE.comment = Off - disabled.\nDepth of Field - standard camera focus blur.\nDistance Blur - blurs distant terrain instead, useful with Distant Horizons
option.END_SUN_EFFECT_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the intensity of the End's sun effect
option.FOG_SMOOTHING.comment = Smooths hard edges in volumetric fog from low-resolution rendering, and varies the fog dither per frame so it converges through TAA
option.FOG_SMOOTHING_RADIUS.comment = Adjusts the radius used to smooth fog edges
option.FXAA_QUALITY.comment = Adjusts the quality of FXAA edge detection, at the expense of performance
option.GRADE_GAMMA.comment = Adjusts the gamma curve of the final image, brightening or darkening midtones
option.GRADE_VIBRANT.comment = Boosts saturation of muted colors more than already-saturated ones, for a more natural-looking saturation increase
option.GTAO_STEPS.comment = Controls how noisy the GTAO appears
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE.comment = Light cast by held items. Off disables it. Normal uses the vanilla blocklight color scaled by the item's light level. Colored uses per-block emissive colors
option.IBL_INTENSITY.comment = Scales the diffuse sky ambient contribution. 1.0 is physically correct; lower values darken sky-lit shadowed areas
option.IBL_SPECULAR_INTENSITY.comment = Scales the sky reflection contribution. 1.0 is physically correct; lower values give subtler reflections. Only active when the IBL master toggle is on
option.IBL_SPECULAR_SAMPLES.comment = Rays traced against the sky for reflections when screen-space reflections are off. 1 uses a fast mirror path; more samples give cleaner rough reflections
option.MATERIAL_MAPPING_MODE.comment = Controls material specular and normal mapping behavior.
option.MOON_PHASE_ATMOSPHERE_STRENGTH.comment = How strongly the moon phase affects the atmosphere's moon glow
option.MOON_PHASE_LIGHTING_STRENGTH.comment = How strongly the moon phase affects night time lighting
option.MOON_PHASE_NIGHT_ATMOSPHERE.comment = The atmosphere's moon glow is affected by the moon phase
option.MOON_PHASE_NIGHT_LIGHTING.comment = Night time brightness is affected by the moon phase
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS.comment = Specular highlights from the moon are dimmed on a new moon
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_STRENGTH.comment = How strongly the moon phase dims specular highlights on a new moon
option.POROSITY.comment = Materials darken when wet, based on the porosity value in the resource pack's labPBR textures
option.POROSITY_STRENGTH.comment = Adjusts how strongly porosity darkens materials when wet
option.RAINBOW_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the brightness of rainbows
option.RAIN_PUDDLES_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the intensity of rain puddles
option.RAIN_PUDDLES_MODE.comment = Off disables puddles. Rain Puddles uses weather-driven wetness. Everywhere applies puddles to all eligible surfaces.
option.RTAO_RADIUS.comment = Adjusts the radius of RTAO - the distance from which objects can occlude each other
option.RTAO_STEPS.comment = Controls how noisy the RTAO appears
option.SHADOW_SSRT.comment = Adjusts ssrt distant shadows.
option.SHADOW_SSRT_STEPS.comment = Adjusts ssrt shadow steps.
option.SKY_GROUND_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the brightness of the visible planet surface below the horizon
option.SNELLS_WINDOW_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the strength of the Snell's Window effect
option.SSGI.comment = Gathers bounce light from the lit scene in screen space. Adds indirect light with color bleeding to shadowed areas
option.SSGI_BOUNCES.comment = Number of true light bounces. Each bounce adds a full screen pass. 1 is cheapest, 3 gives deep multi-bounce color bleed
option.SSGI_FILTER_RADIUS.comment = Radius of the depth-aware blur applied to the bounce light. 0 disables the filter
option.SSGI_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the strength of the bounce light
option.SSGI_RADIUS.comment = How far bounce rays travel, in blocks. Larger radii spread light further but leak through thin geometry
option.SSGI_RAY_STEPS.comment = Steps taken per bounce ray. More steps find more hits but cost performance
option.SSGI_TEMPORAL_ACCUMULATION.comment = Accumulates SSGI over frames with reprojection and depth rejection. Smooths noise but can ghost slightly behind moving objects
option.SSGI_TEMPORAL_WEIGHT.comment = How much history is blended in per frame. Higher is smoother but ghosts more
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the strength of the specular sheen effect
option.SUB_SURFACE_SCATTERING.comment = Simulates light passing through thin materials such as leaves, based on the resource pack's labPBR textures
option.TAA_VARIANCE_CLIPPING.comment = How strongly TAA rejects history samples that deviate from the current frame. Higher values reduce ghosting but can increase flickering
option.WATER_TEXTURE_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the strength of the water texture effect
option.WATER_WAVE_NOISE_STRENGTH.comment = Adjusts the strength of the fine noise detail added to water waves
option.COLORED_LIGHT1_LIGHTS = Colored Lights
option.COLORED_LIGHTS.comment = Tint the vanilla blocklight lightmap with per-block emissive colors instead of a uniform color
option.COLORED_LIGHTS_INTENSITY = Colored Lights Intensity
option.COLORED_LIGHTS_INTENSITY.comment = Controls how strongly per-block colors replace the vanilla blocklight color
option.COLORED_LIGHTS_VANILLA_BLEND = Vanilla Blend
option.COLORED_LIGHTS_VANILLA_BLEND.comment = Blend between vanilla monochrome blocklight and per-block colored blocklight for non-emissive surfaces. 0 = pure vanilla, 1 = full per-block coloring
option.COLORED_LIGHTS_SPREAD = Color Spread
option.COLORED_LIGHTS_SPREAD.comment = Screen-space spread radius for coloring nearby non-emissive surfaces
option.COLORED_LIGHTS_FALLOFF = Falloff Mode
option.COLORED_LIGHTS_FALLOFF.comment = How colored light intensity falls off with distance
value.COLORED_LIGHTS_FALLOFF.COLORED_LIGHTS_FALLOFF_VANILLA = Vanilla
value.COLORED_LIGHTS_FALLOFF.COLORED_LIGHTS_FALLOFF_SMOOTH = Smooth
screen.colored_lights_settings = Colored Lights Settings
